e that we talked to  were a little bit unusual in the sense  that they had  they were like a very very advanced  version of this and what they were doing  was using  data feeds that were coming directly  from the federal aviation administration  we were talking to guys who are air  traffic controllers that were able to  see a lot of things  that  someone off the street wouldn't be able  to see for example so i'm tracking  youtube spy planes with homemade radar  with one of these guys so the so the  guys that we that were  useful  for the purposes of figuring some of  this stuff out we're not exactly the  people at airports writing down um  tail numbers but people doing a very  very advanced version of that  are you in danger since you do such an  overt operation you go barging into  people's  offices and ask them outright no it's  the same as going to the mall and if  you're like being the mall manager what  they're doing they probably wouldn't be  happy to see you either  thank you very much for having us  [Applause]  so  um  for more information on torture taxi on  the trail of the cia's rendition flights  visit co-author trevor paglin's website  at paglin.com  [Music]
 

